(7465797, 1184631, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your ribbon for this very effective and appealing composition. Although these long exposures have been used a lot, in fact they have become somewhat cliched, when done well it is still an effective technique, Im pleased to say you have used it well here. The mono processing is done well with lovely contrasts between the blacks and whites. The balance between the sky and the sea is good too. Thank you for a lovely entry Konrad</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well. Congratulations on your ribbon for this very effective and appealing composition. Although these long exposures have been used a lot, in fact they have become somewhat cliched, when done well it is still an effective technique, Im pleased to say you have used it well here. The mono processing is done well with lovely contrasts between the blacks and whites. The balance between the sky and the sea is good too. Thank you for a lovely entry Konrad', '2016-07-25 08:40:06.000000', NULL, 0),
